# Developer extension-repository seeds.
#
# Copy this file to `dev-repos.txt` (same directory) and put your own repository URLs in it.
# `dev-repos.txt` is gitignored, so your list is compiled into your builds without ever being
# committed to this public repository.
#
# One URL per line. Blank lines are ignored, `#` starts a comment.
# Each URL should point at the directory containing index.min.json or index.json — the same thing
# you would paste into Browse -> Extensions -> Repositories by hand.
#
# The screen that reads this sits behind the passphrase gate described in DeveloperUnlock.kt.
# That gate is obscurity, not security: it keeps the screen out of casual reach, nothing more.
#
# Format example. The URL below is the repository the app already adds by itself on first run
# (ExtensionRepoRepository.DEFAULT_REPO_URL), so listing it achieves nothing — it is here only to
# show the expected shape:
#
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/keiyoushi/extensions/repo
